              { tipo: 'codigo', p: 'Crie <code>static int[] somaColunas(int[][] m)</code> que devolve a soma de cada coluna.', inicio: `static int[] somaColunas(int[][] m) {\n    return new int[0];\n}\n`, teste: `int[][] agenda = {\n    {3, 1, 4},\n    {2, 0, 5},\n    {1, 2, 0}\n};\nSystem.out.println(Arrays.toString(somaColunas(agenda)));`, saida: '[6, 3, 9]', dicas: ['int[] soma = new int[m[0].length];', 'for (int l = 0; l < m.length; l++) for (int c = 0; c < m[l].length; c++) soma[c] += m[l][c];', 'return soma;'], sol: `static int[] somaColunas(int[][] m) {\n    int[] soma = new int[m[0].length];\n    for (int l = 0; l < m.length; l++) {\n        for (int c = 0; c < m[l].length; c++) {\n            soma[c] += m[l][c];\n        }\n    }\n    return soma;\n}` }
